// Ghost Island: a lap of an island of feudal Japan, after Ghost of
// Tsushima, its stretches each in a colour of their own. It crosses the
// castle hill twice, in a figure of eight: first through it, by a tunnel at
// the end of the castle street, and at the end of the lap over it, 33 m
// above, through the castle.
//
// 1. The castle street, north, over a crest where the bike takes off,
//    straight at the castle hill and into the tunnel under it, at its foot.
// 2. Out onto the coast, round to the right, and east along it in esses,
//    past the great torii standing in the sea.
// 3. The shrine on the water: a boardwalk, narrower than the road, straight
//    across an inlet, with a crest in the middle where the bike takes off.
// 4. Up the susuki hills in esses at up to 12 %, south over their rolling
//    top, two crests where the bike takes off, and down at 12 % to the lake.
// 5. Round the lake, clockwise, three sides of it, along a shrine's
//    vermilion fence on the lake's side: fields of flowers down to the
//    water, a water wheel on its shore and, on the outside of the bend at
//    its foot, the great maple over its clearing of red leaves.
// 6. North from the lake to the temple, where the road splits in two: the
//    lap snakes through its courtyard and a way to the left swings out
//    early over a hump.
// 7. Up the red ridge in bends at up to 12 %, most of the way through a
//    narrow corridor of torii, as at Fushimi Inari in Kyoto, to its top,
//    53 m up, and round to the left onto the castle ridge, west.
// 8. Down along the castle ridge, where the road splits three ways again,
//    the other way round, and over the tunnel through the castle hill.
// 9. Up the bamboo hill at 12 %, and down it through the bamboo at 11 % in
//    a run of tight esses, four bends winding like a river, and round to
//    the left into the castle street.
//
// Where things are, in metres from the finish line:
//
// - the castle street:           Span(5821.0, 360.0)
// - the tunnel through the
//   castle hill, opening at the
//   foot of its slope at the end
//   of the castle street:        Span(360.0, 620.0)
// - the coast:                   Span(640.0, 1422.0)
// - the boardwalk:               Span(1422.0, 1622.0), its fences 6 m from
//                                the middle, narrower than the road
// - the susuki hills, from the
//   boardwalk to the lake:       Span(1622.0, 2700.0)
// - the lake shore:              Span(2700.0, 3400.0)
// - along the great maple's
//   clearing, round the foot of
//   the lake:                    Span(3010.0, 3165.0)
// - the red ridge:               Span(3764.0, 4322.0)
// - the corridor of torii up the
//   red ridge, after Fushimi
//   Inari's thousand gates:      Span(3830.0, 4120.0), its walls 6.5 m from
//                                the middle, the gates standing over it
// - the castle ridge:            Span(4322.0, 4880.0)
// - the crossing over the
//   tunnel:                      Span(4672.0, 4880.0)
// - the bamboo:                  Span(4880.0, 5675.0)
// - where the road splits: in two by the temple, 3414.0 to 3764.0, and
//   three ways on the castle ridge, 4322.0 to 4672.0
//
// And where things stand (x, z):
//
// - the lake the road goes round: middle (870.0, 270.0), its shore 150 m
//   out, wandering 8 m; the islet in it (885.0, 255.0), with a wayside
//   shrine (both in src/circuits/ghost_island.rs, with the lake's shore);
// - the clearing of red leaves under the great maple (875.4, 479.9), beside
//   the road round the foot of the lake, 35 m from its centre line on the
//   outside of the bend, away from the water; the middle of the road beside
//   it (at 3086 m), (874.8, 444.9);
// - the shrine on the outside of the bend in the bamboo at 5180 m, 28 m from
//   the road, ahead of the riders coming down to the bend: (-98.9, -305.5);
// - where the pagoda stands before the corridor of torii (34 m to the right
//   of the road at 3780 m): (727.9, -126.5);
// - the islet the great torii stands on, in the sea 56 m from the coast road
//   (at about 1240 m): (497.0, -892.0).
//
// The small props stand 12.8 m from the middle of the road: just past its
// walls.
//
// The island's colours: torii vermilion (0.86, 0.2, 0.09), and white (0.95,
// 0.94, 0.9).
//
// How a circuit's file is written: see src/circuits/data.rs. Its lake and
// its mountains (the volcano across the strait) are functions, in
// src/circuits/ghost_island.rs.
(
    name: "Ghost Island",
    name_en: "Ghost Island",
    description: "Inspirada en Ghost of Tsushima: un castillo cruzado por\ndebajo y por encima, cuestas, un lago entre flores y dos bifurcaciones",
    description_en: "Inspired by Ghost of Tsushima: a castle crossed under and\nover, steep hills, a lake among flowers and two splits",
    // "Blade of the Autumn Gale".
