                // And one more by the castle street.
                (model: Jizo, spot: Road(along: 5881.0, lateral: 12.8)),
            ],
            // The small props over and over along the lap: each stands on
            // its plinth, with the wall opening for it, so that the road is
            // lined with them. Every row takes its kinds in turn, so that no
            // stretch is all of one thing, and the two sides of a stretch are
            // half a step apart, so they do not stand in pairs facing each
            // other (but for the guardians, which come in twos). Where one of
